{"4596990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Good Job", "steam_appid": 4596990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No one ever told you, ”One day you'll run a massage parlor!&quot; And no one ever does...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Job is an unofficial night-job simulation. Sam is in jail. He left the keys with you. Now you’re in charge of a job you could never put on <strong>your resume</strong>. Start in a run-down room, manage your team, satisfy demanding customers, sell controversial products online, collect payments, and grow your underground empire without drawing attention..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you'll do:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a network of <i><strong>underground massage agencies</strong></i> 🙂.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce and sell herbal supplements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage massage therapists, handle appointments, and oversee deliveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a side hustle, build an <strong>e-commerce empire for adults</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect payments. <strong>By any means necessary....</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, sleep, survive… <strong>This city never stops!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/cbd04e5d8330539e7d2a8052061a40db.poster.avif?t=1787646602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/cbd04e5d8330539e7d2a8052061a40db.webm?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/cbd04e5d8330539e7d2a8052061a40db.mp4?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Get ready for one of the toughest simulations you’ll ever play. In this game, your customers have very specific needs! Build your team carefully, manage them well, and keep your customers happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/e86b753a8ae2f2f4ba70a2ea33fb1fad.poster.avif?t=1787646602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/e86b753a8ae2f2f4ba70a2ea33fb1fad.webm?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/e86b753a8ae2f2f4ba70a2ea33fb1fad.mp4?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build your herbal supplement business from the ground up. Produce your products, stock your shelves, and sell online to customers with very specific needs. Every pill matters. Every order is valuable. Every delivery is an opportunity. <i><strong>Completely legal, of course.</strong></i> 😇</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/dffc483be5546be6902aab821ffb7319.poster.avif?t=1787646602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/dffc483be5546be6902aab821ffb7319.webm?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/dffc483be5546be6902aab821ffb7319.mp4?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A tough journey awaits you! There’s so much you need to catch up on! Survival is the most important rule! <br><strong>Eat, sleep, and be sure to earn money!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/f02ebf53b48976c9d21677dfcee9e41c.poster.avif?t=1787646602\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/f02ebf53b48976c9d21677dfcee9e41c.webm?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4596990/extras/f02ebf53b48976c9d21677dfcee9e41c.mp4?t=1787646602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover the perfect blend. The right formula keeps your customers happy, grows your business, and builds your reputation. The wrong choice, however, can throw everything off balance. Chemistry is hard. The rest of the business is even harder. <i><strong>Mix carefully.</strong></i><br><br><br><br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No one ever told you, ”One day you'll run a massage parlor!&quot; And no one ever does...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Job is an unofficial night-job simulation. Sam is in jail. He left the keys with you. Now you’re in charge of a job you could never put on <strong>your resume</strong>. Start in a run-down room, manage your team, satisfy demanding customers, sell controversial products online, collect payments, and grow your underground empire without drawing attention..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you'll do:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a network of <i><strong>underground massage agencies</strong></i> 🙂.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce and sell herbal supplements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mana